  "remarks": "JSC “Scientific and Production Association ‘Android Technology’” develops and manufactures unmanned ground-based robots and unmanned aerial vehicles. One of them is an unmanned reconnaissance and strike vehicle “Marker”. The first 4 robots of this type were deployed to the front in Donbas in 2023. Moreover, the company has also developed a special drone “BAS-80” to be fitted on the robot “Marker” that also was planned to become operational in the combat zone.",
